          <td style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #fde68a;">Rough rule of thumb for non-mortgage costs</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #fde68a;"><strong>Cap Rate (Capitalization Rate)</strong></td>
          <td style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #fde68a;">Annual Net Operating Income (NOI) &divide; Property Value</td>
          <td style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #fde68a;">6.0% &ndash; 9.0% for stable cash-flow markets</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #fde68a;"><strong>Cash-on-Cash Return (CoC)</strong></td>
